# a header cut short
12 bytes -> netlink reply at offset 0 is malformed: invalid netlink buffer length caused by invalid netlink buffer: length is 12 but netlink packets are at least 16 bytes

# a length below the header's
36 bytes -> netlink reply at offset 0 is malformed: invalid netlink buffer length caused by invalid netlink buffer: length field says 8 but netlink packets are at least 36 bytes

# a length beyond the datagram
36 bytes -> netlink reply at offset 0 is malformed: invalid netlink buffer length caused by invalid netlink buffer: length field says 64 the buffer is 36 bytes long

# no error code
16 bytes -> acknowledgment of netlink message 7 is malformed: invalid ErrorBuffer length caused by invalid ErrorBuffer: length is 0 but ErrorBuffer are at least 4 bytes

# 3 bytes of error code
20 bytes -> acknowledgment of netlink message 7 is malformed: invalid ErrorBuffer length caused by invalid ErrorBuffer: length is 3 but ErrorBuffer are at least 4 bytes

# trailing bytes
44 bytes -> netlink reply at offset 36 is malformed: invalid netlink buffer length caused by invalid netlink buffer: length is 8 but netlink packets are at least 16 bytes

# an unpadded last message
37 bytes -> netlink reply of 37 bytes at offset 0 overruns its 37-byte datagram once padded
